      "message": "Since we\u0027re touching this, let\u0027s also make a pass at using the final name for immediates:\n\n - `ImmediateConstantsLayout` -\u003e `ImmediatesLayout`\n - `RenderImmediateConstantsVk` -\u003e `RenderImmediates` (we\u0027re already in the `dawn::native::vulkan` namespace), etc.\n \nDitto in other backends / frontend.\n \n`git grep -i \"immediate\\.\\?constant\"` should return no matches ideally and I think it would be pretty quick to fix with a few find/replace operations (mostly to handle the two casings of Immediate vs. immediate and the pluralization of constant vs. constants).\n\nFor example  `git grep -i -l \"immediate\\.\\?constant\" | xargs sed -i \"\" \"s/ImmediateConstants/Immediates/\"`\n\nBut also feel free to do as a follow-up if that\u0027s too much change for this CL.",
